Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["\<\
Open XXZ chain: sectors, eigenstate entropies, and edge evolution\
\>", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"9dfba224-b147-4344-812a-92e1ad6da911"],

Cell["\<\
Evaluate definitions 1\[Dash]2 once. The sweep (3\[Dash]4) and evolution (5\
\[Dash]7) have independent parameters and diagonalizations. Execution is \
split into editable cells.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"16da855d-1b0a-4a4b-9017-78e188628fe8"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1. Physics definitions", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"20912c48-3fc4-ca45-96d7-89c2e03b9e2b"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Hamiltonian and numerical utilities", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"d6ba82f9-5481-2244-a146-76773f0a1f9d"],

Cell["\<\
Open chain, total size L. S=\[Sigma]/2, \[HBar]=1. H=J \
\[CapitalSigma]\:2c7c(S\:02e3\:2c7cS\:02e3\:2c7c\:208a\:2081+S\:02b8\:2c7cS\
\:02b8\:2c7c\:208a\:2081+\[CapitalDelta]S\:1dbb\:2c7cS\:1dbb\:2c7c\:208a\:2081\
)+h \[CapitalSigma]\:2c7cS\:1dbb\:2c7c+bLeft S\:1dbb\:2081+bRight S\:1dbbL. \
The system is {1,L}; the environment is {2,\[Ellipsis],L\[Minus]1}. J is \
signed.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a9530e64-c4b4-5d43-9f62-c36a3d5c8e19"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", 
