Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
11. Weak exchange-only coupling of the two edge spins: eigenstate g sweep\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"f909bee3-9965-6d4f-b3b0-eb9c190d6277"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["11.1 Model and remaining symmetry sectors", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"0cd3eb55-fd78-5a42-9243-973e7419c0d6"],

Cell["\<\
Here exchange ONLY means the XY (flip-flop) term, with no ZZ interaction on \
either edge bond:
H_exchange(g)=H_bulk+g(S_1^x S_2^x+S_1^y S_2^y+S_(L-1)^x S_L^x+S_(L-1)^y \
S_L^y).
NOTE ON THE USUAL LADDER-OPERATOR EXCHANGE: sigma^+=(sigma^x+i \
sigma^y)/2={{0,1},{0,0}}, sigma^-=(sigma^x-i sigma^y)/2={{0,0},{1,0}}. They \
equal S^+=S^x+i S^y and S^-=S^x-i S^y with the original S=sigma/2 convention. \
Thus S_i^x S_j^x+S_i^y S_j^y=(sigma_i^+ sigma_j^-+sigma_i^- sigma_j^+)/2. The \
edge interaction in this chapter is exactly (g/2)(sigma_1^+ \
sigma_2^-+sigma_1^- sigma_2^+ + sigma_(L-1)^+ sigma_L^-+sigma_(L-1)^- \
sigma_L^+). The matrix element |up,down> <-> |down,up> is g/2. If a different \
paper writes lambda(sigma_i^+ sigma_j^-+sigma_i^- sigma_j^+), its lambda \
equals g/2 here. The code retains the original spin-operator convention \
rather than silently changing the normalization of g.
H_bulk, S=sigma/2, the meaning of g, and zero fields are the same as in 10.1. \
This is an edge XY exchange, not a full Heisenberg or full XXZ edge bond. The \
two original XXZ edge bonds are again replaced.
For g!=0 the individual edge S^z values and the bulk magnetization are no \
longer conserved. Total magnetization M=Sum_i S_i^z remains conserved. Equal \
edge couplings preserve reflection R, and zero fields preserve global spin \
flip F. R and F commute, but F maps m to -m, so the simultaneously resolved \
labels are (m,r) for m!=0 and (m=0,r,f) for m=0. Each r,f is +/-1. A \
magnetization block has dimension Binomial[L,L/2-m] before \
reflection/spin-flip splitting. F gives equal-spectrum opposite-m partners \
rather than another label inside a nonzero-m block.
No full-chain S^2 label is used at Delta=+/-1 because the edge XY anisotropy \
breaks that symmetry. At g=0 the edges decouple and compatible extra \
edge/bulk charges are automatically resolved as in 10.2; the parent (m,r,f) \
labels remain fixed for the sweep. Since exactly degenerate states can be \
chosen in different eigenbases, endpoint entropies and IPR are not unique \
without this symmetry choice. In particular, F-resolved states at g=0 can be \
superpositions involving different edge magnetizations. For Delta=0 the \
entire model is an inhomogeneous XX chain with a free-fermion description; \
this is an additional special integrable limit, not a reason to assume the \
two interacting models have identical generic sectors.
The two chapters have independent parameters, results, plotting arrays, and \
output folders. To run chapter 11 alone, evaluate original definitions 1-2 \
and shared definitions 10.2 and audit definitions 10.3a, then 11.2 onward. \
The ZZ sweep is not required.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"aedafa58-559f-4d49-af38-b3b1a66a3b96"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
11.2 Exchange Hamiltonian and magnetization/reflection sectors\
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"d46cada4-1e3a-4746-8b93-fa180d93de77"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", 
   RowBox[{
   "exEdgeH", ",", "exEdgeSpaces", ",", "exEdgeSetup", ",", "exEdgeED"}], 
   "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"exEdgeH", "[", 
    RowBox[{"g_", ",", "p_Association"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"b", "=", 
       RowBox[{"edgeBonds", "[", 
        RowBox[{"edgeModel", "[", "p", "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"check", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"realQ", "[", "g", "]"}], 
        ",", "\"\<g must be finite and real.\>\""}], "]"}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"b", "[", "\"\<Bulk\>\"", "]"}], "+", 
        RowBox[{"g", " ", 
         RowBox[{"b", "[", "\"\<Exchange\>\"", "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}]}], "\n", 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"exEdgeSpaces", "[", 
    RowBox[{"p_", ",", "tol_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"l", "=", 
        RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<L\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", "bits", ",", "q", ",", 
       "ids", ",", "m", ",", "names", ",", "spaces", ",", 
       RowBox[{"out", "=", 
        RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"bits", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"IntegerDigits", "[", 
          RowBox[{"k", ",", "2", ",", "l"}], "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"k", ",", "0", ",", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"2", "^", "l"}], "-", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"q", "=", 
       RowBox[{"KeyTake", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"charges", "[", "p", "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<R\>\"", ",", "\"\<F\>\""}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Do", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"m", "=", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"l", "/", "2"}], "-", "nDown"}]}], ";", 
         RowBox[{"ids", "=", 
          RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
             RowBox[{"2", "^", "l"}], "]"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
               RowBox[{"bits", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", "#", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], "==", "nDown"}], 
             "&"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
         RowBox[{"names", "=", 
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"m", "==", "0"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"\"\<R\>\"", ",", "\"\<F\>\""}], "}"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", "\"\<R\>\"", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
         RowBox[{"spaces", "=", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"<|", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"\"\<Basis\>\"", "->", 
              RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", 
               RowBox[{"Length", "[", "ids", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"\"\<Labels\>\"", "->", 
              RowBox[{"<|", 
               RowBox[{"\"\<m\>\"", "->", "m"}], "|>"}]}]}], "|>"}], "}"}]}], 
         ";", "\n", "  ", 
         RowBox[{"Do", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"spaces", "=", 
            RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"splitCharge", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"#", ",", 
                  RowBox[{"N", "[", 
                   RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"q", "[", "name", "]"}], "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"ids", ",", "ids"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",",
                   "name", ",", "tol"}], "]"}], "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", 
               "spaces"}], ",", "1"}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"name", ",", "names"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
         RowBox[{"out", "=", 
          RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
           RowBox[{"out", ",", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
               RowBox[{"#", ",", 
                RowBox[{"<|", 
                 RowBox[{"\"\<Indices\>\"", "->", "ids"}], "|>"}]}], "]"}], 
              "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", "spaces"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"nDown", ",", "0", ",", "l"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
      "out"}]}], "\n", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"exEdgeSetup", "[", 
    RowBox[{"p_", ",", 
     RowBox[{"tol_", ":", 
      RowBox[{"10", "^", 
       RowBox[{"-", "10"}]}]}]}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"edgeSetup", "[", 
    RowBox[{"p", ",", "\"\<Exchange\>\"", ",", "exEdgeSpaces", ",", "tol"}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"exEdgeED", "[", 
    RowBox[{"g_", ",", "p_Association", ",", 
     RowBox[{"tol_", ":", 
      RowBox[{"10", "^", 
       RowBox[{"-", "10"}]}]}]}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"edgeED", "[", 
    RowBox[{"g", ",", 
     RowBox[{"exEdgeSetup", "[", 
      RowBox[{"p", ",", "tol"}], "]"}], ",", "tol"}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"da87b2c8-0803-6e42-a193-97ae085b5996"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["11.3 Editable exchange sweep parameters", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"b8ab0f06-2b98-1049-9cec-c5619747861c"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"exModel", "=", 
   RowBox[{"<|", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\"\<L\>\"", "->", "10"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<J\>\"", "->", "1"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<Delta\>\"", "->", "2."}]}], "|>"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"exGGrid", "=", 
    RowBox[{"N", "[", 
     RowBox[{"Subdivide", "[", 
      RowBox[{"0", ",", "1", ",", "200"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "   ", 
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"g", " ", "multiplies", " ", "SxSx"}], "+", "SySy"}], ";", " ", 
    RowBox[{"the", " ", "ladder", " ", "coefficient", " ", "is", " ", 
     RowBox[{"g", "/", "2."}]}]}], " ", "*)"}]}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"exSettings", "=", 
   RowBox[{"<|", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\"\<EDTolerance\>\"", "->", 
      RowBox[{"10", "^", 
       RowBox[{"-", "10"}]}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<MatchingTolerance\>\"", "->", 
