Cell["\<\
Inspect one full eigensystem with \
exOneED=exEdgeED[1/10,exUsed,exSettingsUsed[\"EDTolerance\"]], followed by \
sectorTable[exOneED] and eigenket[exOneED,sector,level]. Rerun 11.3 onward to \
change parameters. Each figure states the actual L,J,Delta, the edge \
interaction, the g range and step, zero fields, and sector dimensions. All \
four plot families use Joined->False, with MarkerSize defaulting to 3 points \
in exSettings. No plotting resampling is performed. For retained data, \
reevaluate 10.2 and the plot/export cells to apply these style changes; a new \
exGGrid requires recomputing 11.4. Data exports contain all eigenvalues and \
scalar eigenstate observables, all sector labels/dimensions, tolerances, and \
endpoint refinements. They do not retain eigenvectors at every g.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"02b10533-4696-1848-870c-9e37471b8e5d"]
}, Closed]],

