Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["12. Independent exchange-sector DOS and gap ratios", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"8aa9bb53-d854-2742-a354-adb3732abb5d"],

Cell["\<\
This chapter has its own model, g grid, selected sector, diagonalization, \
DOS, statistics and output folders. It requires only the general numerical \
definitions in chapter 1, the plotting/export definitions in chapter 2, and \
its own definitions 12.3. Chapters 10, 11 and 13 need not be evaluated. It \
computes every eigenvalue only in the selected sector, without eigenvectors, \
entropy or IPR. Inspect the DOS before selecting the rank window and \
computing means.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"18ed35c5-4a1a-ee4c-af4c-d3bd7dd6a10b"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["12.1 Three comparisons; no single ratio diagnoses chaos", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"29b391b2-b98e-4f49-82ea-0d97fb82e6ba"],

Cell["\<\
(1) Microscopic comparison: lambda=|g|/|J|. This compares the edge exchange \
coefficient with the transverse bulk exchange coefficient. The actual edge \
flip-flop matrix element is g/2, and the longitudinal bulk coefficient is J \
Delta. Keep Delta and the sign of J explicit when comparing different runs.
(2) Nearby-level hybridization: Lambda_nm=|g <n|V|m>|/|E_n^(0)-E_m^(0)|, \
within the same compatible symmetry sector and spectral window. Both the \
matrix elements and the spacings depend on L and Delta. A window-averaged |g| \
v_typ/d_typ can summarize this after defining how the matrix-element and \
spacing samples are selected. Comparing g with the mean level spacing alone \
neglects selection rules and matrix-element size. At g=0, first diagonalize V \
inside each exactly degenerate H0 manifold; never divide by a zero spacing. \
If an uncoupled pair has a vanishing matrix element, its small spacing does \
not imply hybridization.
(3) Low-energy comparison: kappa=|g|/epsilon_op(L,Delta), where epsilon_op is \
a positive bulk excitation energy accessible from the chosen low-energy state \
through the boundary operators S_2^+/- or S_(L-1)^+/-. Treat any degenerate \
ground manifold separately. In the gapless bulk the finite-size low-energy \
scales are typically of order v(Delta)/(L-2), with corrections; in the gapped \
bulk accessible bulk excitations can retain a finite scale. Boundary modes \
and nearly degenerate vacua must not be substituted automatically for the \
bulk gap. This low-energy comparison addresses boundary response and differs \
from spectral mixing in the central many-body band.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"367a51e7-6ca3-d841-830b-cafe3b101fd0"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["12.2 Concrete finite-size spectral comparison", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"b2b4ed9e-fa73-e645-8d2d-e87dcba0c228"],

Cell["\<\
Proposal: for antiferromagnetic J>0, compare L={8,10,12}, extending to L=14 \
when feasible, and Delta={0,0.45,0.5,0.6,1,1.5,3}. Use a common dimensionless \
lambda grid, initially logarithmic over positive lambda, with an explicitly \
separate g=0 endpoint. Refine the grid where the statistics change; no \
interpolation is needed to display the measured samples.
For even L, use (m=0,R=+1,F=+1) as the primary sector and analyze other \
sectors independently as checks. Its dimension is only 23 at L=8, so that \
size is indicative. Never pool equal-spectrum partners or sectors with \
different parities. Start with the middle 50 percent of ranks in each sector \
and record the actual level and ratio counts. This rank window is an \
operational convention, not an identical energy density across all L and \
Delta; check an energy-density window if a quantitative size collapse is \
pursued.
Compute delta_n=E_(n+1)-E_n and \
rtilde_n=Min[delta_n,delta_(n+1)]/Max[delta_n,delta_(n+1)] from unchopped \
energies. The reference means are 2 Log[2]-1=0.386294... for Poisson and \
approximately 0.5307 for a large GOE ensemble; the GOE three-level surmise \
gives a slightly different 0.5359. No unfolding is required for this ratio. \
Reference [2]: Y. Y. Atas et al., Phys. Rev. Lett. 110, 084101 (2013): \
https://arxiv.org/abs/1212.5611 .
Plot mean rtilde versus g/|J| separately for each L,Delta. If the data \
support a crossover, a crossing of the midpoint (0.3863+0.5307)/2=0.4585 can \
be reported descriptively only after checking size, window, gap resolution \
and uncertainty stability. A raw first crossing on a dense correlated g grid \
is not a reliable crossover estimator. Do not assume monotonicity or fit a \
size exponent before observing the curves. Boundary-only perturbations need \
not follow scaling laws derived for extensive bulk perturbations.
Controls: exchange at Delta=0, and the integrable ZZ model in separately \
resolved actual sectors. Integrability does not guarantee Poisson statistics \
for very small sectors or spectra with extra degeneracies. The g=0 free-edge \
spectrum requires endpoint refinements. For any unresolved or zero gap, \
report it; do not silently remove levels.
Reference [3] for the motivating boundary-impurity setting: P. Kattel et al., \
Edge modes and boundary impurities in the anisotropic Heisenberg spin chain, \
section V and appendix C: https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.00194 . Its \
nonintegrable study motivates comparison; it is not a direct verification of \
our XY-only two-edge path or its finite-size crossover.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a6140df5-1868-674f-8afa-418aebf41609"],

Cell["\<\
Special-point control: for the field-free open bulk, tested spectra at \
Delta=+/-1/2 have cross-magnetization degeneracies absent in the tested \
Delta=0.45,0.6,cos(pi/4),cos(pi/5) comparisons. Once free edges are added, \
different bulk magnetizations can occur inside one fixed TOTAL-m sector. \
Their inherited degeneracies can become small splittings at weak g and lower \
the parent-sector mean below Poisson. Do not interpret Delta=1/2 as a generic \
Poisson starting point, or identify a crossover by a midpoint alone. \
Delta=0.45 is the new comparison default; +/-1/2 remain freely selectable \
controls. The underlying degeneracy-generating operator has not been \
established here. Root-of-unity arithmetic alone does not prove the mechanism \
for these free boundary conditions.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3e981db3-bfb0-2b41-acc1-9b8bf1cd8e25"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
12.3 Definitions: direct sector construction, spectra and statistics\
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"d098a4b2-7c90-7c43-8ac5-263d2031e250"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Chapter", "-", 
    RowBox[{"12", " ", "target"}], "-", 
    RowBox[{"sector", " ", 
     RowBox[{"definitions", ".", " ", "No"}], " ", "chapter"}], "-", 
    RowBox[{"11", " ", "or", " ", "chapter"}], "-", 
    RowBox[{"13", " ", "run", " ", "is", " ", 
     RowBox[{"required", "."}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", 
     RowBox[{
     "rgCheck", ",", "rgRealQ", ",", "rgMax", ",", "rgDimension", ",", 
      "rgCatalog", ",", "rgLabels", ",", "rgBasis", ",", "rgAction", ",", 
      "rgSetup"}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"rgCheck", "[", 
      RowBox[{"test_", ",", "message_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"If", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"!", 
        RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", "test", "]"}]}], ",", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
          RowBox[{"message", ",", "Red"}], "]"}], "]"}], ";", 
        RowBox[{"Abort", "[", "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"rgRealQ", "[", "x_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"NumericQ", "[", "x", "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
      RowBox[{"NumberQ", "[", 
       RowBox[{"N", "[", "x", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
      RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Im", "[", 
         RowBox[{"N", "[", "x", "]"}], "]"}], "==", "0"}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"rgMax", "[", "x_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"If", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Head", "[", "x", "]"}], "===", "SparseArray"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
        RowBox[{"0", ",", 
         RowBox[{"Sequence", "@@", 
          RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
           RowBox[{"x", "[", "\"\<NonzeroValues\>\"", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}],
        ",", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
        RowBox[{"0", ",", 
         RowBox[{"Sequence", "@@", 
          RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
            RowBox[{"{", "x", "}"}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
    ";"}]}]}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"8bb8cfeb-25ee-7d47-b35f-\
5af8b8b02e93"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
   "Character", " ", "traces", " ", "give", " ", "dimensions", " ", "without",
     " ", "constructing", " ", "other", " ", "sector", " ", 
    RowBox[{"bases", "."}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"rgDimension", "[", 
      RowBox[{"l_Integer", ",", "lab_Association"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"n", "=", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"l", "/", "2"}], "-", 
           RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<m\>\"", "]"}]}]}], ",", "trR", ",", "d"}],
         "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"!", 
            RowBox[{"IntegerQ", "[", "n", "]"}]}], " ", "||", " ", 
           RowBox[{"n", "<", "0"}], " ", "||", " ", 
           RowBox[{"n", ">", "l"}]}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"Return", "[", "0", "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"d", "=", 
         RowBox[{"Binomial", "[", 
          RowBox[{"l", ",", "n"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"trR", "=", 
         RowBox[{"If", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"EvenQ", "[", "l", "]"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"If", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"EvenQ", "[", "n", "]"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"Binomial", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"l", "/", "2"}], ",", 
               RowBox[{"n", "/", "2"}]}], "]"}], ",", "0"}], "]"}], ",", "\n",
            "   ", 
           RowBox[{"Binomial", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{"l", "-", "1"}], ")"}], "/", "2"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"Floor", "[", 
              RowBox[{"n", "/", "2"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", 
        " ", 
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"n", "==", 
           RowBox[{"l", "/", "2"}]}], ",", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"d", "+", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<R\>\"", "]"}], " ", "trR"}], "+", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<R\>\"", "]"}], " ", 
              RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<F\>\"", "]"}], " ", 
              RowBox[{"2", "^", 
               RowBox[{"(", 
                RowBox[{"l", "/", "2"}], ")"}]}]}]}], ")"}], "/", "4"}], ",", 
          "\n", "   ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"d", "+", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<R\>\"", "]"}], " ", "trR"}]}], ")"}], "/",
            "2"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "\n", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"rgCatalog", "[", "l_Integer", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"labs", ",", "rows"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"labs", "=", 
         RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"If", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"2", " ", "n"}], "==", "l"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
              RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
               RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"<|", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"\"\<m\>\"", "->", "0"}], ",", 
                   RowBox[{"\"\<R\>\"", "->", "r"}], ",", 
                   RowBox[{"\"\<F\>\"", "->", "f"}]}], "|>"}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"r", ",", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"1", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"f", ",", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"1", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], ",",
               "\n", "   ", 
              RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"<|", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"\"\<m\>\"", "->", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"l", "/", "2"}], "-", "n"}]}], ",", 
                  RowBox[{"\"\<R\>\"", "->", "r"}]}], "|>"}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"{", 
                 RowBox[{"r", ",", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"1", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"n", ",", "0", ",", "l"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"rows", "=", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"<|", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"\"\<Labels\>\"", "->", "#"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"\"\<Dimension\>\"", "->", 
               RowBox[{"rgDimension", "[", 
                RowBox[{"l", ",", "#"}], "]"}]}]}], "|>"}], "&"}], " ", "/@", 
           " ", "labs"}], ")"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"SortBy", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
           RowBox[{"rows", ",", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<Dimension\>\"", "]"}], ">", "0"}], 
             "&"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"-", 
              RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<Dimension\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<Labels\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<m\>\"", 
               "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"-", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<Labels\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<m\>\"", 
               "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
             RowBox[{"-", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<Labels\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<R\>\"", 
               "]"}]}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"-", 
              RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<Labels\>\"", "]"}], ",", "\"\<F\>\"", ",",
                 "0"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], "&"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "\n", "]"}]}], 
    ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"rgLabels", "[", 
      RowBox[{"l_Integer", ",", "choice_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"lab", "=", "choice"}], ",", "n"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"choice", "===", "Automatic"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"lab", "=", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"First", "[", 
             RowBox[{"rgCatalog", "[", "l", "]"}], "]"}], 
            "[", "\"\<Labels\>\"", "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"rgCheck", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"AssociationQ", "[", "lab", "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
           RowBox[{"KeyExistsQ", "[", 
            RowBox[{"lab", ",", "\"\<m\>\""}], "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
           RowBox[{"KeyExistsQ", "[", 
            RowBox[{"lab", ",", "\"\<R\>\""}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", 
          "  ", "\"\<Sector must be Automatic or an association containing m \
and R.\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"n", "=", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"l", "/", "2"}], "-", 
          RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<m\>\"", "]"}]}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"rgCheck", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"IntegerQ", "[", "n", "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
           RowBox[{"0", "<=", "n", "<=", "l"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
           RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", "1"}], "}"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<R\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", 
          "  ", "\"\<Use an exact allowed integer/half-integer m, and R=+1 or \
-1.\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"rgCheck", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Sort", "[", 
            RowBox[{"Keys", "[", "lab", "]"}], "]"}], "===", 
           RowBox[{"Sort", "[", 
            RowBox[{"If", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<m\>\"", "]"}], "==", "0"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"\"\<m\>\"", ",", "\"\<R\>\"", ",", "\"\<F\>\""}], 
               "}"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"\"\<m\>\"", ",", "\"\<R\>\""}], "}"}]}], "]"}], 
            "]"}]}], ",", "\n", 
          "  ", "\"\<Use exactly m,R,F at m=0; exactly m,R at nonzero m. F \
maps m to -m.\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<m\>\"", "]"}], "==", "0"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"rgCheck", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", "1"}], "}"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<F\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}], 
            ",", "\"\<F must be +1 or -1.\>\""}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", 
        " ", 
        RowBox[{"rgCheck", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"rgDimension", "[", 
            RowBox[{"l", ",", "lab"}], "]"}], ">", "0"}], 
          ",", "\"\<This symmetry sector is empty at the requested L.\>\""}], 
         "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"KeySort", "[", "lab", "]"}]}]}], "\n", "]"}]}], 
    ";"}]}]}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"8b425ae4-3fbb-7045-8d10-\
8552b949632f"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Enumerate", " ", "only", " ", "fixed"}], "-", 
    RowBox[{"m", " ", "bit", " ", 
     RowBox[{"strings", ".", " ", "Each"}], " ", "symmetry", " ", "orbit", " ",
      "contributes", " ", "at", " ", "most", " ", "one", " ", 
     RowBox[{"column", "."}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"rgBasis", "[", 
     RowBox[{"l_Integer", ",", "lab_Association", ",", "wp_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=",
     " ", 
    RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"n", "=", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"l", "/", "2"}], "-", 
          RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<m\>\"", "]"}]}]}], ",", "states", ",", 
        "index", ",", "seen", ",", 
        RowBox[{"bRules", "=", 
         RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"cols", "=", "0"}], ",", "x", ",", "rx", ",", "orbit", ",", 
        "signs", ",", "\n", "  ", "weights", ",", "rows", ",", "vals", ",", 
        "nn", ",", "b", ",", 
        RowBox[{"dim", "=", 
         RowBox[{"rgDimension", "[", 
          RowBox[{"l", ",", "lab"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"r", "=", 
         RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<R\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", "f"}], "}"}], ",", 
      "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"states", "=", 
        RowBox[{"Sort", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Total", " ", "/@", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Subsets", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"2", "^", 
             RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
              RowBox[{"0", ",", 
               RowBox[{"l", "-", "1"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", "n", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"index", "=", 
        RowBox[{"AssociationThread", "[", 
         RowBox[{"states", ",", 
          RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Length", "[", "states", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
       "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"seen", "=", 
        RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", 
         RowBox[{"False", ",", 
          RowBox[{"Length", "[", "states", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Do", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"seen", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", 
              RowBox[{"index", "[", "x", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"Continue", "[", "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
          RowBox[{"rx", "=", 
           RowBox[{"FromDigits", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Reverse", "[", 
              RowBox[{"IntegerDigits", "[", 
               RowBox[{"x", ",", "2", ",", "l"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", "2"}], 
            "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<m\>\"", "]"}], "==", "0"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"f", "=", 
              RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<F\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
             RowBox[{"orbit", "=", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"x", ",", "rx", ",", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"2", "^", "l"}], "-", "1", "-", "x"}], ",", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"2", "^", "l"}], "-", "1", "-", "rx"}]}], "}"}]}], ";", 
             RowBox[{"signs", "=", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"1", ",", "r", ",", "f", ",", 
                RowBox[{"r", " ", "f"}]}], "}"}]}]}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"orbit", "=", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"x", ",", "rx"}], "}"}]}], ";", 
             RowBox[{"signs", "=", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"1", ",", "r"}], "}"}]}]}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"seen", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", 
             RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", 
              RowBox[{"index", ",", 
               RowBox[{"DeleteDuplicates", "[", "orbit", "]"}]}], "]"}], 
             "]"}], "]"}], "=", "True"}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
          RowBox[{"weights", "=", 
           RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Merge", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
                RowBox[{"Rule", ",", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"orbit", ",", "signs"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
               "Total"}], "]"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"#", "!=", "0"}], "&"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Length", "[", "weights", "]"}], "==", "0"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"Continue", "[", "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
          RowBox[{"cols", "++"}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
          RowBox[{"rows", "=", 
           RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", 
            RowBox[{"index", ",", 
             RowBox[{"Keys", "[", "weights", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
          RowBox[{"vals", "=", 
           RowBox[{"Values", "[", "weights", "]"}]}], ";", 
          RowBox[{"nn", "=", 
           RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
            RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
             RowBox[{"vals", "^", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
          RowBox[{"bRules", "=", 
           RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
            RowBox[{"bRules", ",", 
             RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"#1", ",", "cols"}], "}"}], "->", "#2"}], "&"}], ",", 
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"rows", ",", 
                 RowBox[{"N", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"vals", "/", "nn"}], ",", "wp"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}],
               "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"x", ",", "states"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"rgCheck", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"cols", "==", "dim"}], 
         ",", "\"\<Orbit count does not agree with the character dimension.\>\
\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"b", "=", 
        RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
         RowBox[{"bRules", ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Length", "[", "states", "]"}], ",", "dim"}], "}"}]}], 
         "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"<|", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<L\>\"", "->", "l"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<Labels\>\"", "->", "lab"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<States\>\"", "->", "states"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<Index\>\"", "->", "index"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<Basis\>\"", "->", "b"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<Dimension\>\"", "->", "dim"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<MagnetizationDimension\>\"", "->", 
          RowBox[{"Length", "[", "states", "]"}]}]}], "|>"}]}]}], "\n", 
     "]"}]}], ";"}]}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"e49b7238-e1ef-6842-afab-\
eb2c23560f22"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Apply", " ", "local", " ", "bonds", " ", "to", " ", "the", " ", 
     "selected", " ", "basis"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{
    "without", " ", "making", " ", "a", " ", "full", " ", "Hamiltonian", " ", 
     "or", " ", "other", " ", 
     RowBox[{"sectors", "."}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"rgAction", "[", 
     RowBox[{"basis_", ",", "kind_", ",", "wp_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"l", "=", 
         RowBox[{"basis", "[", "\"\<L\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"states", "=", 
         RowBox[{"basis", "[", "\"\<States\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"index", "=", 
         RowBox[{"basis", "[", "\"\<Index\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"b", "=", 
         RowBox[{"basis", "[", "\"\<Basis\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
        "entries", ",", "terms", ",", "row", ",", "col", ",", "amp", ",", "x",
         ",", "bits", ",", "z", ",", "bonds", ",", "y", ",", "merged"}], 
       "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"entries", "=", 
        RowBox[{"Most", "[", 
         RowBox[{"ArrayRules", "[", "b", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"bonds", "=", 
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"kind", "==", "\"\<EdgeXY\>\""}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"1", ",", 
            RowBox[{"l", "-", "1"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
           RowBox[{"2", ",", 
            RowBox[{"l", "-", "2"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"terms", "=", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Reap", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Do", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"row", "=", 
              RowBox[{"entry", "[", 
               RowBox[{"[", 
                RowBox[{"1", ",", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
             RowBox[{"col", "=", 
              RowBox[{"entry", "[", 
               RowBox[{"[", 
                RowBox[{"1", ",", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
             RowBox[{"amp", "=", 
              RowBox[{"Last", "[", "entry", "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
             RowBox[{"x", "=", 
              RowBox[{"states", "[", 
               RowBox[{"[", "row", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
             RowBox[{"bits", "=", 
              RowBox[{"IntegerDigits", "[", 
               RowBox[{"x", ",", "2", ",", "l"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
             RowBox[{"If", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"kind", "==", "\"\<BulkZZ\>\""}], ",", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"z", "=", 
                 RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"(", 
                    RowBox[{"1", "-", 
                    RowBox[{"2", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"bits", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "j", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], ")"}], 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"(", 
                    RowBox[{"1", "-", 
                    RowBox[{"2", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"bits", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"j", "+", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], ")"}], "/", 
                    "4"}]}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"j", ",", "bonds"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";",
                 "\n", "     ", 
                RowBox[{"If", "[", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"z", "!=", "0"}], ",", 
                  RowBox[{"Sow", "[", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"row", ",", "col"}], "}"}], "->", 
                    RowBox[{"amp", " ", "z"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", 
               "     ", 
               RowBox[{"Do", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"If", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"bits", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "j", "]"}], "]"}], "!=", 
                    RowBox[{"bits", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"j", "+", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"y", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"BitXor", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"x", ",", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"2", "^", 
                    RowBox[{"(", 
                    RowBox[{"l", "-", "j"}], ")"}]}], "+", 
                    RowBox[{"2", "^", 
                    RowBox[{"(", 
                    RowBox[{"l", "-", "j", "-", "1"}], ")"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
                     "\n", "       ", 
                    RowBox[{"Sow", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"index", "[", "y", "]"}], ",", "col"}], "}"}], "->", 
                    RowBox[{"amp", "/", "2"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"j", ",", "bonds"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"entry", ",", "entries"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"If", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"terms", "===", 
          RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"Return", "[", 
          RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", "}"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"Dimensions", "[", "b", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";",
        "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"merged", "=", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"First", "[", "#", "]"}], "[", 
              RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], "->", 
             RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
              RowBox[{"Last", " ", "/@", " ", "#"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], "&"}], 
          " ", "/@", " ", 
          RowBox[{"GatherBy", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"First", "[", "terms", "]"}], ",", "First"}], "]"}]}], 
         ")"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"N", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
            RowBox[{"merged", ",", "1"}], "]"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"Dimensions", "[", "b", "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", "wp"}], 
        "]"}]}]}], "\n", "]"}]}], ";"}]}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"e36981e8-\
cfad-ae45-a403-3e468a965992"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"rgSetup", "[", 
     RowBox[{"l_Integer", ",", "choice_", ",", 
      RowBox[{"wp_", ":", "MachinePrecision"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"tol_", ":", 
       RowBox[{"10", "^", 
        RowBox[{"-", "10"}]}]}]}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"lab", "=", 
         RowBox[{"rgLabels", "[", 
          RowBox[{"l", ",", "choice"}], "]"}]}], ",", "basis", ",", "b", ",", 
        RowBox[{"parts", "=", 
         RowBox[{"<|", "|>"}]}], ",", "a", ",", "h", ",", 
        RowBox[{"leak", "=", "0"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"herm", "=", "0"}], ",", "orth", ",", "scale"}], "}"}], ",", 
      "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"basis", "=", 
        RowBox[{"rgBasis", "[", 
         RowBox[{"l", ",", "lab", ",", "wp"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
       RowBox[{"b", "=", 
        RowBox[{"basis", "[", "\"\<Basis\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"orth", "=", 
        RowBox[{"rgMax", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "b", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
           "b"}], "-", 
          RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Band", "[", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"1", ",", "1"}], "}"}], "]"}], "->", "1"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"basis", "[", "\"\<Dimension\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"basis", "[", "\"\<Dimension\>\"", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], 
           "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Do", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"a", "=", 
           RowBox[{"rgAction", "[", 
            RowBox[{"basis", ",", "kind", ",", "wp"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
          RowBox[{"h", "=", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "b", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
            "a"}]}], ";", 
          RowBox[{"scale", "=", 
           RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
            RowBox[{"1", ",", 
             RowBox[{"rgMax", "[", "a", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
          RowBox[{"leak", "=", 
           RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
            RowBox[{"leak", ",", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"rgMax", "[", 
               RowBox[{"a", "-", 
                RowBox[{"b", " ", ".", " ", "h"}]}], "]"}], "/", "scale"}]}], 
            "]"}]}], ";", 
          RowBox[{"herm", "=", 
           RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
            RowBox[{"herm", ",", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"rgMax", "[", 
               RowBox[{"h", "-", 
                RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "h", "]"}]}], "]"}], "/", 
              "scale"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
          RowBox[{"AssociateTo", "[", 
           RowBox[{"parts", ",", 
            RowBox[{"kind", "->", 
             RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"(", 
                RowBox[{"h", "+", 
                 RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "h", "]"}]}], ")"}], "/", 
               "2"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"kind", ",", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            
            RowBox[{"\"\<BulkXY\>\"", ",", "\"\<BulkZZ\>\"", 
             ",", "\"\<EdgeXY\>\""}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"rgCheck", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
           RowBox[{"orth", ",", "leak", ",", "herm"}], "]"}], "<", "tol"}], 
         ",", "\"\<Target-sector basis or invariance audit failed.\>\""}], 
        "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"<|", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<L\>\"", "->", "l"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<Labels\>\"", "->", "lab"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<Dimension\>\"", "->", 
          RowBox[{"basis", "[", "\"\<Dimension\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<MagnetizationDimension\>\"", "->", 
          RowBox[{"basis", "[", "\"\<MagnetizationDimension\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<Parts\>\"", "->", "parts"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<WorkingPrecision\>\"", "->", "wp"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<Audit\>\"", "->", 
          RowBox[{"<|", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"\"\<BasisError\>\"", "->", "orth"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<RelativeSectorLeakage\>\"", "->", "leak"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<RelativeHermiticityError\>\"", "->", "herm"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<Passed\>\"", "->", "True"}]}], "|>"}]}]}], 
        "|>"}]}]}], "\n", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", 
   RowBox[{
   "ratioModel", ",", "ratioAnisotropyInfo", ",", "ratioSpectrum", ",", 
    "ratioRunCheck", ",", "\n", " ", "exGapRatios", ",", "exGapRows", ",", 
    "exRatioPanel"}], "]"}], ";"}]}], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"03f1b472-1c6f-\
aa4d-b6ec-1895af3b7c01"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"ratioModel", "[", "p_Association", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"l", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", 
        RowBox[{"p", ",", "\"\<L\>\"", ",", 
         RowBox[{"Missing", "[", "\"\<L\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
     "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"check", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"IntegerQ", "[", "l", "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
         RowBox[{"l", ">=", "4"}]}], 
        ",", "\"\<Chapter 12 requires integer L>=4.\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", 
      " ", 
      RowBox[{"check", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", 
            RowBox[{"p", ",", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"\"\<J\>\"", ",", "\"\<Delta\>\""}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",",
            "realQ"}], "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<J\>\"", "]"}], "!=", "0"}]}], ",", "\n", 
        "  ", "\"\<J and Delta must be finite real values, with J \
nonzero.\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"check", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", 
           RowBox[{"p", ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             
             RowBox[{"\"\<h\>\"", ",", "\"\<bLeft\>\"", 
              ",", "\"\<bRight\>\""}], "}"}], ",", "0"}], "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", 
            RowBox[{"#", "==", "0"}], "]"}], "&"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
        "  ", "\"\<Chapter 12 has zero fields and equal XY end bonds.\>\""}], 
       "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"<|", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"\"\<L\>\"", "->", "l"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<J\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<J\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Delta\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<Delta\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<h\>\"", "->", "0"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<bLeft\>\"", "->", "0"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<bRight\>\"", "->", "0"}]}], "|>"}]}]}], "\n", "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"cec69eaa-9ee1-4c47-82c9-139d49384457"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ratioAnisotropyInfo", "[", "delta_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Which", "[", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", 
       RowBox[{"delta", "==", "0"}], "]"}], ",", "\"\<FreeFermionControl\>\"",
       ",", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
          RowBox[{"N", "[", "delta", "]"}], "]"}], "-", 
         RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]}], "]"}], "<=", 
       RowBox[{"10", "^", 
        RowBox[{"-", "12"}]}]}], ",", "\"\<SpecialBulkDegeneracyControl\>\"", 
      ",", "\n", " ", "True", ",", "\"\<GeneralAnisotropy\>\""}], "]"}]}], 
   ";"}], "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
   "All", " ", "eigenvalues", " ", "in", " ", "the", " ", "selected", " ", 
    RowBox[{"block", ".", " ", "No"}], " ", "gap", " ", "ratios", " ", "or", " ",
     "eigenvectors", " ", 
    RowBox[{"here", "."}]}], " ", "*)"}]}]}], "Input",ExpressionUUID->\
"65d6521f-3efc-634d-98f8-fd2304726944"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"ratioSpectrum", "[", 
    RowBox[{"g_", ",", "setup_", ",", "p_", ",", "settings_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=",
    " ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
      "h", ",", "e", ",", "scale", ",", "err1", ",", "err2", ",", "wp", ",", 
       "key", ",", "labels"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"check", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"realQ", "[", "g", "]"}], 
        ",", "\"\<g must be a finite real number.\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", 
      " ", 
      RowBox[{"wp", "=", 
       RowBox[{"settings", "[", "\"\<WorkingPrecision\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"labels", "=", 
       RowBox[{"setup", "[", "\"\<Labels\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"h", "=", 
       RowBox[{"N", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<J\>\"", "]"}], 
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"setup", "[", "\"\<Parts\>\"", "]"}], 
              "[", "\"\<BulkXY\>\"", "]"}], "+", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<Delta\>\"", "]"}], " ", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"setup", "[", "\"\<Parts\>\"", "]"}], 
               "[", "\"\<BulkZZ\>\"", "]"}]}]}], ")"}]}], "+", "\n", "   ", 
          RowBox[{"g", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"setup", "[", "\"\<Parts\>\"", "]"}], 
            "[", "\"\<EdgeXY\>\"", "]"}]}]}], ",", "wp"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n",
       " ", 
      RowBox[{"e", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Eigenvalues", "[", 
        RowBox[{"Normal", "[", "h", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"scale", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
        RowBox[{"1", ",", 
         RowBox[{"rgMax", "[", "h", "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"rgMax", "[", "e", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"check", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Length", "[", "e", "]"}], "==", 
          RowBox[{"setup", "[", "\"\<Dimension\>\"", "]"}]}], " ", "&&", " ", 
         RowBox[{"VectorQ", "[", 
          RowBox[{"e", ",", "NumericQ"}], "]"}], " ", "&&", "\n", "   ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"rgMax", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Im", "[", "e", "]"}], "]"}], "<", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"settings", "[", "\"\<EDTolerance\>\"", "]"}], " ", 
           "scale"}]}]}], 
        ",", "\"\<Selected-block spectrum validation failed.\>\""}], "]"}], ";",
       "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"e", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Sort", "[", 
        RowBox[{"Re", "[", "e", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"err1", "=", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Total", "[", "e", "]"}], "-", 
          RowBox[{"Tr", "[", "h", "]"}]}], "]"}], "/", 
        RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
         RowBox[{"1", ",", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Length", "[", "e", "]"}], " ", "scale"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ";",
       "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"err2", "=", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
           RowBox[{"e", "^", "2"}], "]"}], "-", 
          RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
             RowBox[{"h", "[", "\"\<NonzeroValues\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], "^", 
            "2"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "/", 
        RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
         RowBox[{"1", ",", 
          RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
             RowBox[{"h", "[", "\"\<NonzeroValues\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], "^", 
            "2"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"check", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
          RowBox[{"err1", ",", "err2"}], "]"}], "<", 
         RowBox[{"settings", "[", "\"\<EDTolerance\>\"", "]"}]}], 
        ",", "\"\<Selected-block spectral moment check failed.\>\""}], "]"}], 
      ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"key", "=", 
       RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
          RowBox[{"KeySort", "[", "labels", "]"}], "]"}], ",", "InputForm"}], 
        "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"<|", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"\"\<g\>\"", "->", "g"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Data\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"<|", 
          RowBox[{"key", "->", 
           RowBox[{"<|", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"\"\<Labels\>\"", "->", "labels"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"\"\<Dimension\>\"", "->", 
              RowBox[{"Length", "[", "e", "]"}]}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"\"\<Energies\>\"", "->", "e"}]}], "|>"}]}], "|>"}]}], ",",
         "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<AnisotropyClass\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"ratioAnisotropyInfo", "[", 
          RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<Delta\>\"", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Audit\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"<|", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"\"\<RelativeTraceError\>\"", "->", "err1"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<RelativeSecondMomentError\>\"", "->", "err2"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<Passed\>\"", "->", "True"}]}], "|>"}]}]}], "|>"}]}]}],
     "\n", "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"80654c43-a711-3845-9d47-\
a9d88760a1cd"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"ratioRunCheck", "[", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"(", "\n", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"check", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"ValueQ", "[", "exRatioSpectra", "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
        RowBox[{"ValueQ", "[", "exRatioModelUsed", "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
        RowBox[{"ValueQ", "[", "exRatioGUsed", "]"}]}], ",", "\n", 
       "  ", "\"\<Run the independent selected-spectrum cell 12.4a \
first.\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{"check", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"ratioModel", "[", "exRatioModel", "]"}], "===", 
         "exRatioModelUsed"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
        RowBox[{"exRatioGGrid", "===", "exRatioGUsed"}], " ", "&&", "\n", 
        "   ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"KeySort", "[", "exRatioSector", "]"}], "===", 
         "exRatioSectorComputed"}], " ", "&&", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"KeyTake", "[", 
          RowBox[{"exRatioSettings", ",", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<EDTolerance\>\"", ",", "\"\<WorkingPrecision\>\""}], 
            "}"}]}], "]"}], "===", "exRatioNumericalUsed"}]}], ",", "\n", 
       "  ", "\"\<Model, g grid, sector or ED settings changed: recompute \
12.4a. RankWindow can be changed without new ED.\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", 
     " ", "True"}], "\n", ")"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"9da9c96e-\
76d4-af45-9c8a-369d9699178a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"exGapRatios", "[", 
    RowBox[{"energies_List", ",", 
     RowBox[{"window_", ":", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"1", "/", "4"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"3", "/", "4"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"tol_", ":", 
      RowBox[{"10", "^", 
       RowBox[{"-", "10"}]}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"blockLength_", ":", "10"}]}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\n", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"e", "=", 
        RowBox[{"Sort", "[", "energies", "]"}]}], ",", "d", ",", "lo", ",", 
       "hi", ",", "w", ",", "gaps", ",", "cut", ",", "pairs", ",", "ratios", ",",
        "status", ",", 
       RowBox[{"blocks", "=", 
        RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"nb", "=", "0"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"used", "=", "0"}], ",", "bse"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"check", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", 
          RowBox[{"e", ",", "realQ"}], "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Length", "[", "window", "]"}], "==", "2"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
         RowBox[{"0", "<=", 
          RowBox[{"window", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], "<", 
          RowBox[{"window", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], "<=", "1"}], " ", "&&", "\n", "  ", 
         RowBox[{"realQ", "[", "tol", "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
         RowBox[{"tol", ">", "0"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
         RowBox[{"IntegerQ", "[", "blockLength", "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
         RowBox[{"blockLength", ">=", "2"}]}], 
        ",", "\"\<Invalid ratio settings.\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"d", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Length", "[", "e", "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"lo", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
        RowBox[{"1", ",", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Floor", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"window", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "d"}], "]"}], "+", "1"}]}], 
        "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"hi", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Min", "[", 
        RowBox[{"d", ",", 
         RowBox[{"Ceiling", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"window", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "d"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
       "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"w", "=", 
       RowBox[{"If", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"d", ">", "0"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
          RowBox[{"hi", ">=", "lo"}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"e", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", 
           RowBox[{"lo", ";;", "hi"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"gaps", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Differences", "[", "w", "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"pairs", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Partition", "[", 
        RowBox[{"gaps", ",", "2", ",", "1"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"cut", "=", 
       RowBox[{"tol", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
         RowBox[{"1", ",", 
          RowBox[{"maxAbs", "[", "e", "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"ratios", "=", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Min", "[", "#", "]"}], "<=", "cut"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"Missing", "[", "\"\<UnresolvedGapPair\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Min", "[", "#", "]"}], "/", 
             RowBox[{"Max", "[", "#", "]"}]}]}], "]"}], "&"}], " ", "/@", " ",
          "pairs"}], ")"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"status", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Which", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Length", "[", "w", "]"}], "<", "3"}], 
         ",", "\"\<TooFewLevels\>\"", ",", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Count", "[", 
           RowBox[{"ratios", ",", "_Missing"}], "]"}], ">", "0"}], 
         ",", "\"\<UnresolvedGaps\>\"", ",", "True", ",", "\"\<OK\>\""}], 
        "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"bse", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Missing", "[", "\"\<TooFewBlocks\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", "\n", 
      " ", 
      RowBox[{"If", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"status", "==", "\"\<OK\>\""}], ",", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"blocks", "=", 
          RowBox[{"Partition", "[", 
           RowBox[{"ratios", ",", "blockLength"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
         RowBox[{"nb", "=", 
          RowBox[{"Length", "[", "blocks", "]"}]}], ";", 
         RowBox[{"used", "=", 
          RowBox[{"nb", " ", "blockLength"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
         RowBox[{"If", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"nb", ">=", "4"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"bse", "=", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"StandardDeviation", "[", 
              RowBox[{"Mean", " ", "/@", " ", "blocks"}], "]"}], "/", 
             RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "nb", "]"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ";", 
      "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"<|", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"\"\<SectorDimension\>\"", "->", "d"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<WindowRanks\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"lo", ",", "hi"}], "}"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<WindowLevels\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"Length", "[", "w", "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<GapPairs\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"Length", "[", "pairs", "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<UnresolvedGapPairs\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"Count", "[", 
          RowBox[{"ratios", ",", "_Missing"}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<UnresolvedGaps\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"Count", "[", 
          RowBox[{"gaps", ",", 
           RowBox[{"x_", "/;", 
            RowBox[{"x", "<=", "cut"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<GapResolution\>\"", "->", "cut"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Ratios\>\"", "->", "ratios"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<MeanR\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"If", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"status", "==", "\"\<OK\>\""}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"Mean", "[", "ratios", "]"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"Missing", "[", "status", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", 
        "  ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<IIDSEM\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"If", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"status", "==", "\"\<OK\>\""}], " ", "&&", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Length", "[", "ratios", "]"}], ">=", "2"}]}], ",", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"StandardDeviation", "[", "ratios", "]"}], "/", 
            RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
             RowBox[{"Length", "[", "ratios", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"Missing", "[", "\"\<Unavailable\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",",
         "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<BlockSEM\>\"", "->", "bse"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<BlockLength\>\"", "->", "blockLength"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Blocks\>\"", "->", "nb"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<BlockRatiosUsed\>\"", "->", "used"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<BlockTailRatios\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"If", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"status", "==", "\"\<OK\>\""}], ",", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Length", "[", "ratios", "]"}], "-", "used"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"Missing", "[", "status", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", 
        "  ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<FractionRBelow005\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"If", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"status", "==", "\"\<OK\>\""}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"N", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Count", "[", 
              RowBox[{"ratios", ",", 
               RowBox[{"x_", "/;", 
                RowBox[{"x", "<", 
                 RowBox[{"1", "/", "20"}]}]}]}], "]"}], "/", 
             RowBox[{"Length", "[", "ratios", "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"Missing", "[", "status", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", 
        "  ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<MeanSpacing\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"If", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Length", "[", "gaps", "]"}], ">", "0"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"Mean", "[", "gaps", "]"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"Missing", "[", "\"\<NoGaps\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Status\>\"", "->", "status"}]}], "|>"}]}]}], "\n", 
    "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"22760c70-f918-0b44-b2c9-\
24b4bb6ed237"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"exGapRows", "[", 
    RowBox[{"results_List", ",", "p_", ",", 
     RowBox[{"window_", ":", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"1", "/", "4"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"3", "/", "4"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"tol_", ":", 
      RowBox[{"10", "^", 
       RowBox[{"-", "10"}]}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"blockLength_", ":", "10"}]}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", "\n", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
        RowBox[{"point", ",", 
         RowBox[{"KeyValueMap", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"key", ",", "s"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
             RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"<|", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"\"\<L\>\"", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<L\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"\"\<J\>\"", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<J\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"\"\<Delta\>\"", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<Delta\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"\"\<g\>\"", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"point", "[", "\"\<g\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", "\n", 
                 "    ", 
                 RowBox[{"\"\<gOverJ\>\"", "->", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"point", "[", "\"\<g\>\"", "]"}], "/", 
                   RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<J\>\"", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"\"\<SectorKey\>\"", "->", "key"}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"\"\<Labels\>\"", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"s", "[", "\"\<Labels\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", "\n", 
                 "    ", 
                 RowBox[{"\"\<AnisotropyClass\>\"", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"ratioAnisotropyInfo", "[", 
                   RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<Delta\>\"", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], 
                "|>"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
               RowBox[{"If", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"point", "[", "\"\<g\>\"", "]"}], "==", "0"}], 
                  "]"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
                 RowBox[{"<|", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"\"\<SectorDimension\>\"", "->", 
                    RowBox[{"s", "[", "\"\<Dimension\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
                   
                   RowBox[{"\"\<Status\>\"", 
                    "->", "\"\<DecoupledEndpoint\>\""}], ",", "\n", "      ", 
                   RowBox[{"\"\<MeanR\>\"", "->", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "Missing", "[", "\"\<EndpointHasAdditionalSymmetries\>\"",
                     "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "      ", 
                   
                   RowBox[{"\"\<Reason\>\"", 
                    "->", "\"\<At g=0 the parent sector is reducible; its \
mean is withheld.\>\""}]}], "|>"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
                 RowBox[{"exGapRatios", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"s", "[", "\"\<Energies\>\"", "]"}], ",", "window",
                    ",", "tol", ",", "blockLength"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
              "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"point", "[", "\"\<Data\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",",
        "results"}], "]"}], ",", "1"}], "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",ExpressionUUI\
D->"52c2f066-946c-3d46-a7a6-db1b9e1f8c2b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"exRatioPanel", "[", 
    RowBox[{"rows_List", ",", "labels_Association", ",", "p_", ",", 
     RowBox[{"window_", ":", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"1", "/", "4"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"3", "/", "4"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"marker_", ":", "3"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"errorKey_", ":", "\"\<BlockSEM\>\""}]}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\n", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
      "selected", ",", "valid", ",", "points", ",", "cap", ",", "graph"}], 
      "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"check", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"None", ",", "\"\<IIDSEM\>\"", ",", "\"\<BlockSEM\>\""}], 
           "}"}], ",", "errorKey"}], "]"}], 
        ",", "\"\<Invalid ErrorBar choice.\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"selected", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
        RowBox[{"rows", ",", 
         RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
          RowBox[{"row", ",", 
           RowBox[{"And", "@@", 
            RowBox[{"KeyValueMap", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"row", "[", "\"\<Labels\>\"", "]"}], ",", "#1", ",", 
                  RowBox[{"Missing", "[", "\"\<Label\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}], "==",
                 "#2"}], "&"}], ",", "labels"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
      ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"valid", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
        RowBox[{"selected", ",", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"NumericQ", "[", 
           RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<MeanR\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], "&"}]}], "]"}]}], 
      ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"check", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"valid", "=!=", 
         RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], 
        ",", "\"\<This sector has no resolved means in the selected window.\>\
\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"points", "=", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<gOverJ\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"If", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"errorKey", "=!=", "None"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
               RowBox[{"NumericQ", "[", 
                RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"#", ",", "errorKey", ",", 
                  RowBox[{"Missing", "[", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", 
              "   ", 
              RowBox[{"Around", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<MeanR\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"#", "[", "errorKey", "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<MeanR\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], 
          "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", "valid"}], ")"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"cap", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Column", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"caption", "[", 
            RowBox[{"p", ",", 
             RowBox[{"\"\<\\\\Delta=\>\"", "<>", 
              RowBox[{"texNumber", "[", 
               RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<Delta\>\"", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ",",
            "\n", "   ", 
           RowBox[{"tex", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"sectorLabel", "[", "labels", "]"}], 
              "<>", "\"\<;\\\\quad D=\>\"", "<>", 
              RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"First", "[", "selected", "]"}], 
                "[", "\"\<SectorDimension\>\"", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", "13"}], 
            "]"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
           RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"\"\<Rank window \>\"", "<>", 
              RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
               RowBox[{"window", ",", "InputForm"}], "]"}], 
              "<>", "\"\<; error bars: \>\"", "<>", 
              RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "errorKey", "]"}], 
              "<>", "\"\< (diagnostic).\>\""}], ",", "12"}], "]"}], ",", "\n",
            "   ", 
           RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             
             RowBox[{"\"\<Poisson: 0.386294; GOE: approximately 0.5307. \
Omitted means: \>\"", "<>", 
              RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"Length", "[", "selected", "]"}], "-", 
                RowBox[{"Length", "[", "valid", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", "12"}],
             "]"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
           RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"ratioAnisotropyInfo", "[", 
               RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<Delta\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], "<>", 
              RowBox[{"If", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"ratioAnisotropyInfo", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<Delta\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], 
                 "==", "\"\<SpecialBulkDegeneracyControl\>\""}], ",", "\n", 
                "     ", "\"\<: weak-g means can be biased by inherited \
near-degenerate multiplets.\>\"", ",", "\"\<\>\""}], "]"}]}], ",", "12"}], 
            "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"Alignment", "->", "Center"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"graph", "=", 
       RowBox[{"ListPlot", "[", 
        RowBox[{"points", ",", 
         RowBox[{"Joined", "->", "False"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"PlotStyle", "->", 
          RowBox[{"Directive", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Blue", ",", 
            RowBox[{"AbsolutePointSize", "[", "marker", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",",
          "\n", "  ", 
         RowBox[{"IntervalMarkers", "->", "\"\<Bars\>\""}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"Frame", "->", "True"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"Axes", "->", "False"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"PlotRange", "->", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"All", ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"0", ",", "1"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
         RowBox[{"FrameLabel", "->", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"tex", "[", 
             RowBox[{"\"\<g/|J|\>\"", ",", "19"}], "]"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"tex", "[", 
             RowBox[{"\"\<\\\\langle\\\\tilde r\\\\rangle\>\"", ",", "19"}], 
             "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
         RowBox[{"FrameTicks", "->", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"ticks", "[", 
               RowBox[{"0", ",", "1"}], "]"}], ",", "None"}], "}"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"ticks", "@@", 
               RowBox[{"MinMax", "[", 
                RowBox[{"N", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"valid", ",", "\"\<gOverJ\>\""}], "]"}], "]"}], 
                "]"}]}], ",", "None"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"ImageSize", "->", "1100"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"plotPanel", "[", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<\\\\text{Independent exchange-sector gap ratios}\>\"", ",",
         "cap", ",", "graph"}], "]"}]}]}], "\n", "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",Expr\
essionUUID->"40a9342e-88ea-294c-87a4-6b65b9083049"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["12.4 Editable model, g grid, sector and numerical settings", \
"Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"47e5f7c9-a60b-4f45-b177-93db4c2b0844"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"exRatioModel", "=", 
   RowBox[{"<|", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\"\<L\>\"", "->", "14"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<J\>\"", "->", "1"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<Delta\>\"", "->", 
      RowBox[{"9", "/", "20"}]}]}], "|>"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"exRatioGGrid", "=", 
   RowBox[{"N", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Subdivide", "[", 
     RowBox[{"0", ",", "1", ",", "100"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"exRatioSector", "=", 
    RowBox[{"<|", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"\"\<m\>\"", "->", "0"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<R\>\"", "->", "1"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<F\>\"", "->", "1"}]}], "|>"}]}], ";"}], " ", 
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
   "For", " ", "another", " ", "sector", " ", "use", " ", "exact", " ", "m", " ",
     "and", " ", "valid", " ", 
    RowBox[{"R", "/", "F"}], " ", 
    RowBox[{"labels", "."}]}], " ", "*)"}]}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"exRatioSettings", "=", 
   RowBox[{"<|", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\"\<RankWindow\>\"", "->", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"1", "/", "4"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"3", "/", "4"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<GapResolution\>\"", "->", 
      RowBox[{"10", "^", 
       RowBox[{"-", "10"}]}]}], ",", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<EDTolerance\>\"", "->", 
      RowBox[{"10", "^", 
       RowBox[{"-", "10"}]}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<WorkingPrecision\>\"", "->", "MachinePrecision"}], ",", 
     "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<MinimumDimension\>\"", "->", "500"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<BlockLength\>\"", "->", "10"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<MarkerSize\>\"", "->", "3"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<ErrorBar\>\"", "->", "\"\<BlockSEM\>\""}]}], "|>"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"exRatioOutputRoot", "=", 
   RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"baseFolder", "[", "]"}], 
      ",", "\"\<xxz_gap_ratio_results\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"exRatioRunLabel", "=", "\"\<Exchange_gap_ratios\>\""}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"dc013e4b-0589-d746-aa3a-f9e86208122b"],

Cell["\<\
This default sector has D=890 at L=14. Replace exRatioSector with <|\"m\"->1,\
\"R\"->1|> for the largest even-L block (D=1519 at L=14). The selected block \
must meet MinimumDimension; lower that setting explicitly for small \
validation runs. For high precision supply exact/high-precision J,Delta and g \
values; remove N from an exact grid. This chapter uses increasing real g \
values; chapter 13 retains separate linear and logarithmic size scans.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b6a5cb53-3fa6-0a4d-92c8-1cc55f097858"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
12.4a Compute the complete selected-sector spectra; no gap ratios yet\
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"48c36d4c-5e49-e940-984e-a942e672bfe3"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"exRatioModelUsed", "=", 
   RowBox[{"ratioModel", "[", "exRatioModel", "]"}]}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"exRatioGUsed", "=", "exRatioGGrid"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"exRatioNumericalUsed", "=", 
   RowBox[{"KeyTake", "[", 
    RowBox[{"exRatioSettings", ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<EDTolerance\>\"", ",", "\"\<WorkingPrecision\>\""}], 
      "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"check", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"ListQ", "[", "exRatioGUsed", "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Length", "[", "exRatioGUsed", "]"}], ">=", "2"}], " ", "&&", 
     " ", 
     RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", 
      RowBox[{"exRatioGUsed", ",", "realQ"}], "]"}], " ", "&&", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{"And", "@@", 
      RowBox[{"Thread", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Differences", "[", "exRatioGUsed", "]"}], ">", "0"}], 
       "]"}]}]}], 
    ",", "\"\<The independent g grid must be real and strictly \
increasing.\>\""}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"check", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"exRatioSettings", "[", "\"\<WorkingPrecision\>\"", "]"}], "===",
       "MachinePrecision"}], " ", "||", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"IntegerQ", "[", 
        RowBox[{"exRatioSettings", "[", "\"\<WorkingPrecision\>\"", "]"}], 
        "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"exRatioSettings", "[", "\"\<WorkingPrecision\>\"", "]"}], ">=",
         "20"}]}], ")"}]}], ",", "\"\<Invalid WorkingPrecision.\>\""}], "]"}],
   ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"If", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"exRatioSettings", "[", "\"\<WorkingPrecision\>\"", "]"}], "=!=",
      "MachinePrecision"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
    RowBox[{"check", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"FreeQ", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", 
           RowBox[{"exRatioModelUsed", ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"\"\<J\>\"", ",", "\"\<Delta\>\""}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",",
           "exRatioGUsed"}], "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"_", "?", "MachineNumberQ"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
      "  ", "\"\<High precision requires exact or high-precision \
parameters/grid values.\>\""}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"check", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"realQ", "[", 
      RowBox[{"exRatioSettings", "[", "\"\<EDTolerance\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], 
     " ", "&&", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"exRatioSettings", "[", "\"\<EDTolerance\>\"", "]"}], ">", 
      "0"}], " ", "&&", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{"IntegerQ", "[", 
      RowBox[{"exRatioSettings", "[", "\"\<MinimumDimension\>\"", "]"}], 
      "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"exRatioSettings", "[", "\"\<MinimumDimension\>\"", "]"}], ">=",
       "1"}]}], ",", "\"\<Invalid ED tolerance or MinimumDimension.\>\""}], 
   "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"exRatioSectorComputed", "=", 
   RowBox[{"rgLabels", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"exRatioModelUsed", "[", "\"\<L\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
     "exRatioSector"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"check", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"rgDimension", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"exRatioModelUsed", "[", "\"\<L\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
       "exRatioSectorComputed"}], "]"}], ">=", 
     RowBox[{"exRatioSettings", "[", "\"\<MinimumDimension\>\"", "]"}]}], ",",
     "\n", " ", "\"\<Selected sector is below MinimumDimension. Increase L or \
explicitly lower the minimum.\>\""}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"If", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"ratioAnisotropyInfo", "[", 
      RowBox[{"exRatioModelUsed", "[", "\"\<Delta\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], 
     "==", "\"\<SpecialBulkDegeneracyControl\>\""}], ",", "\n", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
     RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<Delta=+/-1/2: special bulk degeneracies can affect \
weak-coupling gap ratios. Compare 0.45 or 0.6.\>\"", ",", "DarkOrange"}], 
      "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"exRatioSetup", "=", 
   RowBox[{"rgSetup", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"exRatioModelUsed", "[", "\"\<L\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
     "exRatioSectorComputed", ",", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{"exRatioNumericalUsed", "[", "\"\<WorkingPrecision\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"exRatioNumericalUsed", "[", "\"\<EDTolerance\>\"", "]"}]}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"exRatioSeconds", ",", "exRatioSpectra"}], "}"}], "=", 
   RowBox[{"AbsoluteTiming", "[", "\n", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"ratioSpectrum", "[", 
