Cell["\<\
Change exRatioSettings[\"RankWindow\"] and rerun 12.4.1-12.4.2 to inspect the \
corresponding energy bounds, then compute 12.5. Changing only the window, bin \
count or ratio tolerances does not require diagonalization. Different g \
values stay separate. DOS exports retain the complete selected spectra and \
actual labels. No chapter-11 data or directory is used.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"37cf3acb-2bb7-774f-9f25-9fa87fbb5427"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

