            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"\"\<MarkerSize\>\"", ",", "\"\<ErrorBar\>\""}], "}"}]}],
            "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<SetupAudit\>\"", "->", 
          RowBox[{"KeyDrop", "[", 
           RowBox[{"exRatioSetup", ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", "\"\<Parts\>\"", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<Spectra\>\"", "->", "exRatioSpectra"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<SpectrumSeconds\>\"", "->", "exRatioSeconds"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<Results\>\"", "->", "exGapReport"}]}], "|>"}], 
       ",", "\"\<WXF\>\""}], "]"}], "]"}], 
    ",", "\"\<Gap-ratio export failed.\>\""}], "]"}], ";"}]}], "Input",Express\
ionUUID->"b31a3c19-34df-7e48-a6aa-072750c82700"],

Cell["\<\
Chapter 11 and chapter 12 have independent run parameters and results. Run \
chapter 11 for all-sector spectra, eigenstate entropies and IPR; run chapter \
12 for one selected sector, its DOS and spectral ratios. To rerun chapter 12 \
after changing L,J,Delta,g,sector or ED precision, use 12.4a onward. A \
different RankWindow or gap-resolution/block-length choice requires only DOS \
preview and 12.5 onward. Error bars are descriptive, since adjacent ratios \
and nearby g samples are correlated. g=0 stays a separate diagnostic without \
a parent-sector mean. No automatic crossover is fitted.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c94dcf82-3f01-cd4b-bd65-93460298a85f"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
13. Independent selected-sector gap ratios across system sizes\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"160ebb92-8145-774b-b608-d7c0199fbd84"],

Cell["\<\
Run 13.2 once, then either 13.3 (linear g) or 13.4 (logarithmic g). No \
earlier definitions, Hamiltonians, diagonalizations, exResults, or exports \
are required. The two runs have separate editable configurations, results, \
plots and folders. In each configuration, Sector is near the top: Automatic \
selects the largest sector of the stated classification; replace it with an \
explicit association to analyze another sector. LValues, J, Delta, g limits \
and g-point count are all independent of earlier chapters.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2612923e-db87-3a4d-9417-1769d9c7b0f4"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["13.1 Model, sector choice, dimensions and statistic", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"9da72f44-d28d-d44f-b816-01f00fe63999"],

Cell["\<\
Follow-up control: Delta defaults to 9/20=0.45 in both branches; all user \
grid limits, point counts and MinimumDimension values are retained. \
Delta=+/-1/2 is still allowed and flagged as SpecialBulkDegeneracyControl. \
Numerical bulk-sector comparisons establish extra spectral coincidences at \
these points for the tested free-end chains. Their algebraic generator and \
relation to phantom roots are not established here. A sub-Poisson weak-g mean \
is therefore not evidence of a stronger form of integrability, and a midpoint \
crossover needs an independently checked starting regime. FractionRBelow005 \
records the resolved fraction of ratios below 0.05; Poisson predicts \
2*0.05/(1+0.05)=0.095238. Missing means and unresolved gaps are retained.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"dfa5dc66-1ce4-434d-bbd5-e3b727145949"],

Cell["\<\
H=J Sum_(i=2)^(L-2) (S_i^x S_(i+1)^x+S_i^y S_(i+1)^y+Delta S_i^z S_(i+1)^z) + \
g(S_1^x S_2^x+S_1^y S_2^y+S_(L-1)^x S_L^x+S_(L-1)^y S_L^y), S=sigma/2. Both \
end bonds have the same g; there are no fields. The opposite-spin hopping \
amplitude is J/2 in the bulk and g/2 at either end.
Use (m,R) for nonzero m and (m=0,R,F) at zero m, with R,F=+/-1. F is the \
product of Pauli sigma-x matrices, independent of L-dependent rotation \
phases. Automatic chooses the largest block by exact character dimensions, \
breaking ties toward positive m then positive parity. For even L>=6 this \
gives m=1,R=+1 (opposite-m partners are not pooled); for odd L the largest \
block is m=1/2,R=+1. Run even and odd size families separately. The selected \
labels must agree across all L in one run.
For even L=10,12,14,16 the default dimensions are 110,396,1519,5720. The \
m=0,R=+1,F=+1 alternative has 71,252,890,3299. MinimumDimension is enforced \
using the editable value in each branch; lower it explicitly for small \
validation runs. All eigenvalues of the selected block are computed before \
taking the middle rank window; do not use a few extremal eigenvalues for \
central-band statistics.
The basis is generated from fixed-m spin configurations and R/F orbits. Only \
the selected basis and its three projected bond matrices are built. Character \
formulas count other sectors without constructing them. There is no full 2^L \
Hamiltonian, no ED of other sectors, and no eigenvector or entropy \
calculation. Basis orthogonality, invariance of every bond part and \
Hermiticity are checked before the scan. Dense full-spectrum ED still costs \
O(D^2) memory and roughly O(D^3) work per g; the basis construction also \
scales with Binomial[L,L/2-m]. Sizes run sequentially.
The common sectors remain invariant for all real Delta and g, but at g=0 they \
contain additional conserved edge/bulk quantities. Therefore that point has \
status DecoupledEndpoint and no reported mean. At Delta=0, free-fermion \
conserved quantities make this an integrable control, not a generic GOE \
sector. At Delta=+/-1 with g!=0 the XY-only edge bonds do not restore \
full-chain S^2. No claim of complete irreducibility at every exceptional \
parameter point is made.
For sorted selected-sector energies, delta_n=E_(n+1)-E_n and \
r_n=Min[delta_n,delta_(n+1)]/Max[delta_n,delta_(n+1)]. Ranks are floor(a D)+1 \
through ceil(b D), clipped to the spectrum. GapResolution times Max[1,max \
|E|] flags unresolved gaps. No levels are removed and any unresolved pair \
makes MeanR Missing. The unaltered energies may be retained with \
StoreEnergies=True. WorkingPrecision can be increased, using \
exact/high-precision parameters; machine decimals are rejected for an \
arbitrary-precision run.
IIDSEM=sample standard deviation/Sqrt[number of ratios] assumes independent \
samples. BlockSEM uses nonoverlapping blocks of consecutive ratios and \
requires at least four blocks; its final incomplete block is omitted only \
from this uncertainty estimate, with the count recorded. MeanR always uses \
all resolved ratios. Neither estimate is a calibrated confidence interval for \
this deterministic spectrum. Vary BlockLength, rank window and L; do not \
infer a crossover from a noisy first crossing. Ratios at nearby g are \
correlated and are not extra independent samples.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f4415fe0-a3d8-794d-b00b-42f8f60914a9"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
13.2 Standalone definitions: basis, spectra, statistics, plots and export\
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"70bb86e3-c0eb-674f-b3a3-2fca52a0db97"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Standalone", " ", "chapter"}], "-", 
    RowBox[{"13", " ", 
     RowBox[{"definitions", ".", " ", "No"}], " ", "earlier", " ", "chapters",
      " ", "or", " ", "results", " ", "are", " ", 
     RowBox[{"required", "."}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", 
     RowBox[{
     "sgCheck", ",", "sgRealQ", ",", "sgMax", ",", "sgDimension", ",", 
      "sgCatalog", ",", "sgLabels", ",", "sgBasis", ",", "\n", " ", 
      "sgAction", ",", "sgSetup", ",", "sgStatistics", ",", "sgPoint", ",", 
      "sgGrid", ",", "sgValidate", ",", "sgScan", ",", "\n", " ", "sgPlot", ",",
       "sgExport", ",", "sgBaseFolder"}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"sgCheck", "[", 
      RowBox[{"test_", ",", "message_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"If", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"!", 
        RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", "test", "]"}]}], ",", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
          RowBox[{"message", ",", "Red"}], "]"}], "]"}], ";", 
        RowBox[{"Abort", "[", "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"sgRealQ", "[", "x_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"NumericQ", "[", "x", "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
      RowBox[{"NumberQ", "[", 
       RowBox[{"N", "[", "x", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
      RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Im", "[", 
         RowBox[{"N", "[", "x", "]"}], "]"}], "==", "0"}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"sgMax", "[", "x_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"If", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Head", "[", "x", "]"}], "===", "SparseArray"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
        RowBox[{"0", ",", 
         RowBox[{"Sequence", "@@", 
          RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
           RowBox[{"x", "[", "\"\<NonzeroValues\>\"", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}],
        ",", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
        RowBox[{"0", ",", 
         RowBox[{"Sequence", "@@", 
          RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
            RowBox[{"{", "x", "}"}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
    ";"}]}]}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"3549cd26-6813-ec4a-bb9a-\
6902987e5a99"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
   "Character", " ", "traces", " ", "give", " ", "dimensions", " ", "without",
     " ", "constructing", " ", "other", " ", "sector", " ", 
    RowBox[{"bases", "."}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"sgDimension", "[", 
      RowBox[{"l_Integer", ",", "lab_Association"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"n", "=", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"l", "/", "2"}], "-", 
           RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<m\>\"", "]"}]}]}], ",", "trR", ",", "d"}],
         "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"!", 
            RowBox[{"IntegerQ", "[", "n", "]"}]}], " ", "||", " ", 
           RowBox[{"n", "<", "0"}], " ", "||", " ", 
           RowBox[{"n", ">", "l"}]}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"Return", "[", "0", "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"d", "=", 
         RowBox[{"Binomial", "[", 
          RowBox[{"l", ",", "n"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"trR", "=", 
         RowBox[{"If", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"EvenQ", "[", "l", "]"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"If", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"EvenQ", "[", "n", "]"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"Binomial", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"l", "/", "2"}], ",", 
               RowBox[{"n", "/", "2"}]}], "]"}], ",", "0"}], "]"}], ",", "\n",
            "   ", 
           RowBox[{"Binomial", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{"l", "-", "1"}], ")"}], "/", "2"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"Floor", "[", 
              RowBox[{"n", "/", "2"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", 
        " ", 
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"n", "==", 
           RowBox[{"l", "/", "2"}]}], ",", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"d", "+", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<R\>\"", "]"}], " ", "trR"}], "+", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<R\>\"", "]"}], " ", 
              RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<F\>\"", "]"}], " ", 
              RowBox[{"2", "^", 
               RowBox[{"(", 
                RowBox[{"l", "/", "2"}], ")"}]}]}]}], ")"}], "/", "4"}], ",", 
          "\n", "   ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"d", "+", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<R\>\"", "]"}], " ", "trR"}]}], ")"}], "/",
            "2"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "\n", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"sgCatalog", "[", "l_Integer", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"labs", ",", "rows"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"labs", "=", 
         RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"If", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"2", " ", "n"}], "==", "l"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
              RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
               RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"<|", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"\"\<m\>\"", "->", "0"}], ",", 
                   RowBox[{"\"\<R\>\"", "->", "r"}], ",", 
                   RowBox[{"\"\<F\>\"", "->", "f"}]}], "|>"}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"r", ",", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"1", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"f", ",", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"1", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], ",",
               "\n", "   ", 
              RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"<|", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"\"\<m\>\"", "->", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"l", "/", "2"}], "-", "n"}]}], ",", 
                  RowBox[{"\"\<R\>\"", "->", "r"}]}], "|>"}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"{", 
                 RowBox[{"r", ",", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"1", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"n", ",", "0", ",", "l"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"rows", "=", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"<|", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"\"\<Labels\>\"", "->", "#"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"\"\<Dimension\>\"", "->", 
               RowBox[{"sgDimension", "[", 
                RowBox[{"l", ",", "#"}], "]"}]}]}], "|>"}], "&"}], " ", "/@", 
           " ", "labs"}], ")"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"SortBy", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
           RowBox[{"rows", ",", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<Dimension\>\"", "]"}], ">", "0"}], 
             "&"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"-", 
              RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<Dimension\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<Labels\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<m\>\"", 
               "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"-", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<Labels\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<m\>\"", 
               "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
             RowBox[{"-", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<Labels\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<R\>\"", 
               "]"}]}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"-", 
              RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<Labels\>\"", "]"}], ",", "\"\<F\>\"", ",",
                 "0"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], "&"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "\n", "]"}]}], 
    ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"sgLabels", "[", 
      RowBox[{"l_Integer", ",", "choice_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"lab", "=", "choice"}], ",", "n"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"choice", "===", "Automatic"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"lab", "=", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"First", "[", 
             RowBox[{"sgCatalog", "[", "l", "]"}], "]"}], 
            "[", "\"\<Labels\>\"", "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"sgCheck", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"AssociationQ", "[", "lab", "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
           RowBox[{"KeyExistsQ", "[", 
            RowBox[{"lab", ",", "\"\<m\>\""}], "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
           RowBox[{"KeyExistsQ", "[", 
            RowBox[{"lab", ",", "\"\<R\>\""}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", 
          "  ", "\"\<Sector must be Automatic or an association containing m \
and R.\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"n", "=", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"l", "/", "2"}], "-", 
          RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<m\>\"", "]"}]}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"sgCheck", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"IntegerQ", "[", "n", "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
           RowBox[{"0", "<=", "n", "<=", "l"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
           RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", "1"}], "}"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<R\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", 
          "  ", "\"\<Use an exact allowed integer/half-integer m, and R=+1 or \
-1.\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"sgCheck", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Sort", "[", 
            RowBox[{"Keys", "[", "lab", "]"}], "]"}], "===", 
           RowBox[{"Sort", "[", 
            RowBox[{"If", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<m\>\"", "]"}], "==", "0"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"\"\<m\>\"", ",", "\"\<R\>\"", ",", "\"\<F\>\""}], 
               "}"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"\"\<m\>\"", ",", "\"\<R\>\""}], "}"}]}], "]"}], 
            "]"}]}], ",", "\n", 
          "  ", "\"\<Use exactly m,R,F at m=0; exactly m,R at nonzero m. F \
maps m to -m.\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<m\>\"", "]"}], "==", "0"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"sgCheck", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", "1"}], "}"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<F\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}], 
            ",", "\"\<F must be +1 or -1.\>\""}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", 
        " ", 
        RowBox[{"sgCheck", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"sgDimension", "[", 
            RowBox[{"l", ",", "lab"}], "]"}], ">", "0"}], 
          ",", "\"\<This symmetry sector is empty at the requested L.\>\""}], 
         "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
        RowBox[{"KeySort", "[", "lab", "]"}]}]}], "\n", "]"}]}], 
    ";"}]}]}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"99c75103-0321-9343-8acd-\
5c08e770ce26"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Enumerate", " ", "only", " ", "fixed"}], "-", 
    RowBox[{"m", " ", "bit", " ", 
     RowBox[{"strings", ".", " ", "Each"}], " ", "symmetry", " ", "orbit", " ",
      "contributes", " ", "at", " ", "most", " ", "one", " ", 
     RowBox[{"column", "."}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"sgBasis", "[", 
     RowBox[{"l_Integer", ",", "lab_Association", ",", "wp_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=",
     " ", 
    RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"n", "=", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"l", "/", "2"}], "-", 
          RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<m\>\"", "]"}]}]}], ",", "states", ",", 
        "index", ",", "seen", ",", 
        RowBox[{"bRules", "=", 
         RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"cols", "=", "0"}], ",", "x", ",", "rx", ",", "orbit", ",", 
        "signs", ",", "\n", "  ", "weights", ",", "rows", ",", "vals", ",", 
        "nn", ",", "b", ",", 
        RowBox[{"dim", "=", 
         RowBox[{"sgDimension", "[", 
          RowBox[{"l", ",", "lab"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"r", "=", 
         RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<R\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", "f"}], "}"}], ",", 
      "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"states", "=", 
        RowBox[{"Sort", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Total", " ", "/@", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Subsets", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"2", "^", 
             RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
              RowBox[{"0", ",", 
               RowBox[{"l", "-", "1"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", "n", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"index", "=", 
        RowBox[{"AssociationThread", "[", 
         RowBox[{"states", ",", 
          RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Length", "[", "states", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
       "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"seen", "=", 
        RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", 
         RowBox[{"False", ",", 
          RowBox[{"Length", "[", "states", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Do", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"seen", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", 
              RowBox[{"index", "[", "x", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"Continue", "[", "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
          RowBox[{"rx", "=", 
           RowBox[{"FromDigits", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Reverse", "[", 
              RowBox[{"IntegerDigits", "[", 
               RowBox[{"x", ",", "2", ",", "l"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", "2"}], 
            "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<m\>\"", "]"}], "==", "0"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"f", "=", 
              RowBox[{"lab", "[", "\"\<F\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
             RowBox[{"orbit", "=", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"x", ",", "rx", ",", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"2", "^", "l"}], "-", "1", "-", "x"}], ",", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"2", "^", "l"}], "-", "1", "-", "rx"}]}], "}"}]}], ";", 
             RowBox[{"signs", "=", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"1", ",", "r", ",", "f", ",", 
                RowBox[{"r", " ", "f"}]}], "}"}]}]}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"orbit", "=", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"x", ",", "rx"}], "}"}]}], ";", 
             RowBox[{"signs", "=", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"1", ",", "r"}], "}"}]}]}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"seen", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", 
             RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", 
              RowBox[{"index", ",", 
               RowBox[{"DeleteDuplicates", "[", "orbit", "]"}]}], "]"}], 
             "]"}], "]"}], "=", "True"}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
          RowBox[{"weights", "=", 
           RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Merge", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
                RowBox[{"Rule", ",", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"orbit", ",", "signs"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
               "Total"}], "]"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"#", "!=", "0"}], "&"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Length", "[", "weights", "]"}], "==", "0"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"Continue", "[", "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
          RowBox[{"cols", "++"}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
          RowBox[{"rows", "=", 
           RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", 
            RowBox[{"index", ",", 
             RowBox[{"Keys", "[", "weights", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
          RowBox[{"vals", "=", 
           RowBox[{"Values", "[", "weights", "]"}]}], ";", 
          RowBox[{"nn", "=", 
           RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
            RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
             RowBox[{"vals", "^", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
          RowBox[{"bRules", "=", 
           RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
            RowBox[{"bRules", ",", 
             RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"#1", ",", "cols"}], "}"}], "->", "#2"}], "&"}], ",", 
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"rows", ",", 
                 RowBox[{"N", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"vals", "/", "nn"}], ",", "wp"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}],
               "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"x", ",", "states"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"sgCheck", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"cols", "==", "dim"}], 
         ",", "\"\<Orbit count does not agree with the character dimension.\>\
\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"b", "=", 
        RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
         RowBox[{"bRules", ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Length", "[", "states", "]"}], ",", "dim"}], "}"}]}], 
         "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"<|", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<L\>\"", "->", "l"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<Labels\>\"", "->", "lab"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<States\>\"", "->", "states"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<Index\>\"", "->", "index"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<Basis\>\"", "->", "b"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<Dimension\>\"", "->", "dim"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<MagnetizationDimension\>\"", "->", 
          RowBox[{"Length", "[", "states", "]"}]}]}], "|>"}]}]}], "\n", 
     "]"}]}], ";"}]}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"b73dd299-af29-3f43-ad44-\
f0d40db03190"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "Apply", " ", "local", " ", "bonds", " ", "to", " ", "the", " ", 
     "selected", " ", "basis"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{
    "without", " ", "making", " ", "a", " ", "full", " ", "Hamiltonian", " ", 
     "or", " ", "other", " ", 
     RowBox[{"sectors", "."}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"sgAction", "[", 
     RowBox[{"basis_", ",", "kind_", ",", "wp_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"l", "=", 
         RowBox[{"basis", "[", "\"\<L\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"states", "=", 
         RowBox[{"basis", "[", "\"\<States\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"index", "=", 
         RowBox[{"basis", "[", "\"\<Index\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"b", "=", 
         RowBox[{"basis", "[", "\"\<Basis\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
        "entries", ",", "terms", ",", "row", ",", "col", ",", "amp", ",", "x",
         ",", "bits", ",", "z", ",", "bonds", ",", "y", ",", "merged"}], 
       "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"entries", "=", 
        RowBox[{"Most", "[", 
         RowBox[{"ArrayRules", "[", "b", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"bonds", "=", 
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"kind", "==", "\"\<EdgeXY\>\""}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"1", ",", 
            RowBox[{"l", "-", "1"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
           RowBox[{"2", ",", 
            RowBox[{"l", "-", "2"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"terms", "=", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Reap", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Do", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"row", "=", 
              RowBox[{"entry", "[", 
               RowBox[{"[", 
                RowBox[{"1", ",", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
             RowBox[{"col", "=", 
              RowBox[{"entry", "[", 
               RowBox[{"[", 
                RowBox[{"1", ",", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
             RowBox[{"amp", "=", 
              RowBox[{"Last", "[", "entry", "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
             RowBox[{"x", "=", 
              RowBox[{"states", "[", 
               RowBox[{"[", "row", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
             RowBox[{"bits", "=", 
              RowBox[{"IntegerDigits", "[", 
               RowBox[{"x", ",", "2", ",", "l"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
             RowBox[{"If", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"kind", "==", "\"\<BulkZZ\>\""}], ",", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"z", "=", 
                 RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"(", 
                    RowBox[{"1", "-", 
                    RowBox[{"2", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"bits", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "j", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], ")"}], 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"(", 
                    RowBox[{"1", "-", 
                    RowBox[{"2", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"bits", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"j", "+", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], ")"}], "/", 
                    "4"}]}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"j", ",", "bonds"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";",
                 "\n", "     ", 
                RowBox[{"If", "[", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"z", "!=", "0"}], ",", 
                  RowBox[{"Sow", "[", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"row", ",", "col"}], "}"}], "->", 
                    RowBox[{"amp", " ", "z"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", 
               "     ", 
               RowBox[{"Do", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"If", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"bits", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "j", "]"}], "]"}], "!=", 
                    RowBox[{"bits", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"j", "+", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"y", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"BitXor", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"x", ",", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"2", "^", 
                    RowBox[{"(", 
                    RowBox[{"l", "-", "j"}], ")"}]}], "+", 
                    RowBox[{"2", "^", 
                    RowBox[{"(", 
                    RowBox[{"l", "-", "j", "-", "1"}], ")"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
                     "\n", "       ", 
                    RowBox[{"Sow", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"index", "[", "y", "]"}], ",", "col"}], "}"}], "->", 
                    RowBox[{"amp", "/", "2"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"j", ",", "bonds"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"entry", ",", "entries"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"If", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"terms", "===", 
          RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"Return", "[", 
          RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", "}"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"Dimensions", "[", "b", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";",
        "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"merged", "=", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"First", "[", "#", "]"}], "[", 
              RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], "->", 
             RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
              RowBox[{"Last", " ", "/@", " ", "#"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], "&"}], 
          " ", "/@", " ", 
          RowBox[{"GatherBy", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"First", "[", "terms", "]"}], ",", "First"}], "]"}]}], 
         ")"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"N", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
            RowBox[{"merged", ",", "1"}], "]"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"Dimensions", "[", "b", "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", "wp"}], 
        "]"}]}]}], "\n", "]"}]}], ";"}]}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"7358b564-\
d772-134d-a70d-394488edc313"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"sgSetup", "[", 
    RowBox[{"l_Integer", ",", "choice_", ",", 
     RowBox[{"wp_", ":", "MachinePrecision"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"tol_", ":", 
      RowBox[{"10", "^", 
       RowBox[{"-", "10"}]}]}]}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\n", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"lab", "=", 
        RowBox[{"sgLabels", "[", 
         RowBox[{"l", ",", "choice"}], "]"}]}], ",", "basis", ",", "b", ",", 
       RowBox[{"parts", "=", 
        RowBox[{"<|", "|>"}]}], ",", "a", ",", "h", ",", 
       RowBox[{"leak", "=", "0"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"herm", "=", "0"}], ",", "orth", ",", "scale"}], "}"}], ",", 
     "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"basis", "=", 
       RowBox[{"sgBasis", "[", 
        RowBox[{"l", ",", "lab", ",", "wp"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"b", "=", 
       RowBox[{"basis", "[", "\"\<Basis\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"orth", "=", 
       RowBox[{"sgMax", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "b", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "b"}],
          "-", 
         RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Band", "[", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"1", ",", "1"}], "}"}], "]"}], "->", "1"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"basis", "[", "\"\<Dimension\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"basis", "[", "\"\<Dimension\>\"", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], 
          "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Do", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"a", "=", 
          RowBox[{"sgAction", "[", 
           RowBox[{"basis", ",", "kind", ",", "wp"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
         RowBox[{"h", "=", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "b", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
           "a"}]}], ";", 
         RowBox[{"scale", "=", 
          RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
           RowBox[{"1", ",", 
            RowBox[{"sgMax", "[", "a", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
         RowBox[{"leak", "=", 
          RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
           RowBox[{"leak", ",", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"sgMax", "[", 
              RowBox[{"a", "-", 
               RowBox[{"b", " ", ".", " ", "h"}]}], "]"}], "/", "scale"}]}], 
           "]"}]}], ";", 
         RowBox[{"herm", "=", 
          RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
           RowBox[{"herm", ",", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"sgMax", "[", 
              RowBox[{"h", "-", 
               RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "h", "]"}]}], "]"}], "/", 
             "scale"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
         RowBox[{"AssociateTo", "[", 
          RowBox[{"parts", ",", 
           RowBox[{"kind", "->", 
            RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{"h", "+", 
                RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "h", "]"}]}], ")"}], "/", 
              "2"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"kind", ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           
           RowBox[{"\"\<BulkXY\>\"", ",", "\"\<BulkZZ\>\"", 
            ",", "\"\<EdgeXY\>\""}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"sgCheck", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
          RowBox[{"orth", ",", "leak", ",", "herm"}], "]"}], "<", "tol"}], 
        ",", "\"\<Target-sector basis or invariance audit failed.\>\""}], 
       "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"<|", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"\"\<L\>\"", "->", "l"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Labels\>\"", "->", "lab"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Dimension\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"basis", "[", "\"\<Dimension\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<MagnetizationDimension\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"basis", "[", "\"\<MagnetizationDimension\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Parts\>\"", "->", "parts"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<WorkingPrecision\>\"", "->", "wp"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Audit\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"<|", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"\"\<BasisError\>\"", "->", "orth"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<RelativeSectorLeakage\>\"", "->", "leak"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<RelativeHermiticityError\>\"", "->", "herm"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<Passed\>\"", "->", "True"}]}], "|>"}]}]}], "|>"}]}]}],
     "\n", "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"6cb5e468-293d-da4f-b839-\
59f917ab59c1"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"sgAnisotropyInfo", "[", "delta_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Which", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", 
      RowBox[{"delta", "==", "0"}], "]"}], ",", "\"\<FreeFermionControl\>\"", 
     ",", "\n", " ", 
