     RowBox[{"\"\<ErrorBar\>\"", "->", "\"\<BlockSEM\>\""}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<ImageSize\>\"", "->", "1100"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<UseMaTeX\>\"", "->", "True"}]}], "|>"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"sgLogOutputRoot", "=", 
   RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"sgBaseFolder", "[", "]"}], 
      ",", "\"\<xxz_selected_sector_results\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"sgLogRunLabel", "=", "\"\<Log_g\>\""}], ";"}]}], "Input",Expression\
UUID->"a27e67f0-fa75-4047-bd95-f6bc1d06c97c"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["13.4.1 Generate the grid and inspect exact sector sizes", \
"Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"a22276a2-d7fd-4941-9320-49cf656ccc7c"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"sgLogUsed", "=", 
   RowBox[{"sgValidate", "[", "sgLogConfig", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"If", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"sgAnisotropyInfo", "[", 
      RowBox[{"sgLogUsed", "[", "\"\<Delta\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], 
     "==", "\"\<SpecialBulkDegeneracyControl\>\""}], ",", "\n", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
     RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<Delta=+/-1/2: special bulk degeneracy control; compare \
0.45 or 0.6.\>\"", ",", "DarkOrange"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"sgLogGrid", "=", 
   RowBox[{"sgGrid", "[", "sgLogUsed", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"sgLogDimensions", "=", 
   RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"With", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"lab", "=", 
         RowBox[{"sgLabels", "[", 
          RowBox[{"l", ",", 
           RowBox[{"sgLogUsed", "[", "\"\<Sector\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
        "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
       RowBox[{"<|", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<L\>\"", "->", "l"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<Labels\>\"", "->", "lab"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<Dimension\>\"", "->", 
          RowBox[{"sgDimension", "[", 
           RowBox[{"l", ",", "lab"}], "]"}]}]}], "|>"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"l", ",", 
       RowBox[{"sgLogUsed", "[", "\"\<LValues\>\"", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}],
   ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Dataset", "[", "sgLogDimensions", "]"}]}], "Input",ExpressionUUID->\
"771532f0-1191-f348-b207-c37bac2ea636"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
13.4.2 Construct the selected block and compute its full spectrum at every g\
\>", "Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"dd7331c7-a950-0b4e-afa1-a0a7f83f2123"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"sgCheck", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"sgLogConfig", "===", "sgLogUsed"}], 
    ",", "\"\<Parameters changed: regenerate the grid first.\>\""}], "]"}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"sgLogRun", "=", 
   RowBox[{"sgScan", "[", 
    RowBox[{"sgLogUsed", ",", "sgLogGrid"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Dataset", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"KeyDrop", "[", 
     RowBox[{"#", ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<Ratios\>\"", ",", "\"\<Energies\>\""}], "}"}]}], "]"}], 
    "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", 
   RowBox[{"sgLogRun", "[", "\"\<Results\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "Input",Expre\
ssionUUID->"17512c72-dad4-7549-b8e6-a05e8e0c20e1"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["13.4.3 Plot the retained means and diagnostic error bars", \
"Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"00d853ed-68a5-a347-b048-7d33f605652d"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"sgLogPlot", "=", 
   RowBox[{"sgPlot", "[", 
    RowBox[{"sgLogRun", ",", "sgLogStyle"}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", "sgLogPlot"}], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"3bcf5ee7-9f6d-8243-\
9a60-60d0c532d444"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["13.4.4 Export this run", "Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"5e138bf1-b4ca-b248-94ea-88e4076a0ba4"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"sgLogDirectory", "=", 
   RowBox[{"sgExport", "[", 
    RowBox[{
    "sgLogRun", ",", "sgLogPlot", ",", "sgLogStyle", ",", "\n", " ", 
     "sgLogOutputRoot", ",", "sgLogRunLabel"}], "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",Expre\
ssionUUID->"351a2042-e067-b048-a7e2-20c9d8d14164"],

Cell["\<\
Style-only changes require only the plot/export cells. Changing L, sector, J, \
Delta, g grid, precision, rank window or numerical tolerances requires \
regenerating the grid and recomputing this run. Exports contain settings \
actually used, actual labels and dimensions, all g values, raw ratios, \
optional full selected-sector spectra, diagnostics and the plot. New numbered \
folders preserve earlier runs. The log grid contains no zero or negative g. \
Only the horizontal g/|J| axis is logarithmic; the ratio axis remains linear.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8c0c1ed7-7a5d-164b-8ef5-e7876669e10e"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
},
